  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "🌍 Minecraft World Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for survival, hardcore, creative, cosy, funny and adventure worlds."
    },
    "intro": "A world name is the first thing you see on the world list, so it's worth more than \"New World (3)\". This **Minecraft world name generator** makes names to suit how you play: survival, hardcore, creative, cosy, funny or adventure.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Picking a world name",
        "content": "<ul><li><strong>Name it for how you'll play:</strong> a hardcore world wants something grim, a creative world something grand, and a cosy world something soft.</li><li><strong>Keep it short.</strong> Long names get cut off in the world list.</li><li><strong>Playing with friends?</strong> A name everyone recognises saves \"which one was it?\" every time you load up.</li><li><strong>You can change it later</strong> from the world's settings (Edit, on Java Edition), so don't worry about getting it perfect.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "The styles",
        "content": "<ul><li><strong>Survival</strong> and <strong>adventure:</strong> names with a sense of a journey, like First Wilderness or Dragon's Saga.</li><li><strong>Hardcore:</strong> one life, so the name might as well be a warning.</li><li><strong>Creative:</strong> big, open names for a world where anything gets built.</li><li><strong>Cosy:</strong> cottagecore and aesthetic names, like Fern Patch or Bumble Village.</li><li><strong>Funny:</strong> for the world everyone knows will end in disaster: Don't Die Again.</li></ul><p>Running it as a server? Try the <a href=\"minecraft-server-name-generator.html\">Minecraft Server Name Generator</a>, and name the towns inside it with the <a href=\"minecraft-town-name-generator.html\">Minecraft Town Name Generator</a>.</p><p>For everything else in Minecraft, see all the <a href=\"../categories/minecraft-names.html\">Minecraft name generators</a>.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "What's a good name for a Minecraft world?",
        "answer": "One that suits how you play: pick survival, hardcore, creative, cosy, funny or adventure and generate a few."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can you rename a Minecraft world?",
        "answer": "Yes. On Java Edition, select the world, choose Edit and change the name. On Bedrock, use the pencil icon next to the world."
      },
      {
        "question": "What's a good name for a world with friends?",
        "answer": "Something short that everyone will recognise in the list. The funny and adventure styles work well for shared worlds."
      }
    ]
